      "text": "נחמק</i>: <b><big>מתני'</big></b> <i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Forbidden Foods\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>הכחל <i data-commentator=\"Shiltei HaGiborim\" data-label=\"א\" data-order=\"1\"></i>קורעו",
